  <p id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p001:m0000" ref="iop_ybd_afm">蕭昭業</persName>母<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p001:m0004" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">王后</persName></p>
  <p id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p002:m0000" ref="f5r_lge_gw3">蕭子顯</persName>《齊書》曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p002:m0009" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">文安王皇后</persName>，諱<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p002:m0016" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">寶明</persName>，琅琊臨沂人。建元元年，爲南陽王妃。四年，爲皇太子妃，無寵。太子爲宮人制新麗衣服及首飾，而後床帷陳設古舊，釵鑷十餘枚，永明十一年，爲皇太了太妃。<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-wangbaoming:p002:m0090" ref="iop_ybd_afm">郁林王</persName>即位，尊爲皇太后，稱宣德宮。</p>
</text>
